  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 2002.04 New Hampshire coastal program (NHCP)",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 2002.04 “New Hampshire coastal program (NHCP)” means New Hampshire’s coastal management program approved by NOAA under the federal Coastal Zone Management Act (CZMA), 16 U.S.C. §§1451-1465, to enhance overall coastal resource management.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Wq 2000) #8411, eff 8-19-05; ss by #9570, eff 10-17-09",
